      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"FilterRegistrationBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\"><code>FilterRegistrationBean</code></a> instance to be registered with the\nspecified <a href=\"ServletRegistrationBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\"><code>ServletRegistrationBean</code></a>s.",
