      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"#setFilter(T)\"><code>Filter</code></a> must be specified before calling\n<a href=\"RegistrationBean.html#onStartup(jakarta.servlet.ServletContext)\"><code>RegistrationBean.onStartup(ServletContext)</code></a>. Registrations can be associated with\n<a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html#setUrlPatterns(java.util.Collection)\"><code>URL patterns</code></a> and/or servlets (either by <a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html#setServletNames(java.util.Collection)\"><code>name</code></a> or through a <a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html#setServletRegistrationBeans(java.util.Collection)\"><code>ServletRegistrationBean</code></a>s). When\nno URL pattern or servlets are specified the filter will be associated to '/*'. The\nfilter name will be deduced if not specified.",
      "translation": "在调用<a href=\"RegistrationBean.html#onStartup(jakarta.servlet.ServletContext)\"><code>RegistrationBean.onStartup(ServletContext)</code></a>之前，必须指定<code>Filter</code><a href=\"#setFilter(T)\"></a>。注册可以与<a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html#setUrlPatterns(java.util.Collection)\"><code>URL 模式</code></a>和/或 servlet（通过<a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html#setServletNames(java.util.Collection)\"><code>name</code></a>或通过<servletRegistrationBeans(java.util.Collection)\"><code>ServletRegistrationBean</code></a>s）关联。当未指定 URL 模式或 servlet 时，过滤器将关联到'/*'。如果未指定过滤器名称，则会自动推导该名称。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Filter.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Filter</code></a> to be registered.",
      "translation": "返回要注册的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Filter.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Filter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
